+# Business Logic Model — EPIC-1 Mid-Cycle Subscription Upgrade
+
+**Depth**: Standard · **Layer**: `src/backend/main.py`
+**Companion documents**: `business-rules.md` (BR-1..BR-10) · `domain-entities.md` · `frontend-components.md`
