+
+> **Version**: 1.0.0 · **Generated**: 2026-08-31T12:20:00Z · **AIRE**: v1.0
+> **Derived from**:
+> - `.spec/aire-docs/planning/reverse-engineering/knowledge-graph.md` (Atlas doc 3155)
+> - `.spec/aire-docs/planning/requirements/epic-brief.md` (Atlas doc 3157)
